;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本棚明るい.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"The first generation... the second generation... 
{PAUSE ""}
And the existence of a third generation..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Kotaro<STYLE ID="1">, are you still looking things up? It's already late."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh, <STYLE ID="1">Sakura</STYLE>. Where's <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE>?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I put her to bed upstairs."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本棚真横.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Did you see <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, and I heard about the situation, too. They keep going mad and passing out, over and over. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">At this rate, there's no telling when it'll break them for good..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Damn it...! How did it come to this...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hey, <STYLE ID="1">Sakura</STYLE>, there's something I want to ask <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Do you know what Droga is?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Droga...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　No, I've never heard of it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">No, wait, Droga is probably Portuguese, isn't it? It means a drug or something."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Is that so? I didn't know what the word actually meant..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What's going on?"</STYLE><PG>
"Apparently Droga is a drug that boosts physical ability. It seems it used to be made in this settlement long ago."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Don't you know anything about that kind of thing?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Um, that's―"</STYLE><PG>
"No, never mind. 
{PAUSE ""}
More importantly, it looks like I'm close to finding a wonder drug."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Really!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Yeah. You know that liquid we always use at memorial services? Like offering incense."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"'Falsificaso,' right."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Apparently that's the wonder drug. Supposedly, injecting it will cure them."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"It just so happens we'll use it at </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s memorial service, so nobody will be suspicious if we make some. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But is it safe to suddenly inject something like that? What about side effects?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I'll work out what to do about that next."
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------